    "오, 했군요! 했다고 적어둘게요." : {
      "comment" : "조약돌 문구 — Phrasing.say/pick 이 실행 중에 찾는다",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Oh, you did it! I'll note that down."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Oh, you did it! I'll note that down."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "哦，做到了！我帮你记下来。"
